{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_190","type":"agent_message","text":"給餌監査で見つけた原因は、1人に最大10個の小麦を持たせる設計でした。遠い3頭が同時に危険日へ入ると1人の経路が間に合いません。配布を1人1個へ分散し、FEEDを1日欠いた家畜は全仕事より上の緊急度へ昇格しました。修正後は12 seed自己対戦の両側24個体で逃亡0です。平均bankは約1.7k下がりましたが、回復不能事故ゼロを優先します。続けて給水由来の雑草化も同じ方法で監査します。"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_191","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \".venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\nimport concurrent.futures,sys\nsys.path.insert(0,'tools')\ndef one(seed):\n import engine\n aa=[engine.load_agent('main.py'),engine.load_agent('main.py')];prev=[{},{}];miss=[0,0];maxcu=[0,0]\n def w(i):\n  def f(o):\n   cur={};step=o['step']\n   for y,row in enumerate(o['farms'][i]['tiles']):\n    for x,t in enumerate(row):\n     if isinstance(t,dict):\n      if t.get('kind')=='PLANT':cur[(x,y)]=dict(t);maxcu[i]=max(maxcu[i],int(t.get('consecutive_unwatered',0)))\n      elif t.get('kind')=='WEED' and (x,y) in prev[i]:\n       old=prev[i][(x,y)];ml=int(old.get('max_lifespan_step',-1))\n       if ml<0 or step<ml:miss[i]+=1\n   prev[i]=cur;return aa[i](o)\n  return f\n engine.play(w(0),w(1),seed);return seed,miss,maxcu\nwith concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor(max_workers=8) as ex:r=list(ex.map(one,range(1,13)))\nprint(r);print('watering_weeds',sum(sum(x[1])for x in r),'max_consecutive_unwatered',max(max(x[2])for x in r))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
